he boat negative join here as well as at the HALMET's supply. Pins from HALMET.kicad_pcb (hatlabs/HALMET-hardware); GPIO 32 from symphony firmware/halmet/src/halmet_const.h." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;fontColor=#444444;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="530" width="1220" height="60" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root>
